AdaViG builds on MathCanvas (https://github.com/shiwk24/MathCanvas)
and BAGEL (https://github.com/ByteDance-Seed/Bagel).

The inference dependency files were taken from MathCanvas commit
9b48cc81ab1f63d418a954e4502c3c6274068a7b. AdaViG changes the inference
loop, early-diffusion attention instrumentation, gate, runtime metrics,
data handlers, and benchmark evaluators. Original source headers and the
Apache-2.0 license are retained. Model weights and datasets are distributed
separately by their respective owners under their own terms.

Some benchmark scoring functions are adapted from lmms-eval, as noted
in their source files: https://github.com/EvolvingLMMs-Lab/lmms-eval

The lmms-eval license text is preserved in licenses/lmms-eval.LICENSE.
